{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_77_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，諸侯城緣陵。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"其曰諸侯，散辭也。聚而曰散何也？諸侯城，有散辭也，桓德衰矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，季姬及繒子遇於防，使繒子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"遇者，同謀也。來朝者，來請己也。朝不言使，言使，非正也，以病繒子也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，辛卯，沙鹿崩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"林屬於山為鹿。沙，山名也。無崩道而崩，故志之也。其日，重其變也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"四、狄侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"五、冬，蔡侯肸卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_77_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_77","textTraditional":"諸侯時卒，惡之也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}